<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Accuracy of multi-modal models on identical questions across two modalities: image + text versus image + audio. All evaluated models perform substantially worse when queries are spoken rather than written, illustrating the current gap in robust audio-visual integration.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
