<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Source Datasets</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Tab. <a href="#A5.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix E Source Datasets ‣ VoiceAssistant-Eval: Benchmarking AI Assistants across Listening, Speaking, and Viewing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> provides an overview of the diverse set of source datasets included in our benchmark. For each dataset, we list the number of samples incorporated into <span id="A5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">VoiceAssistant-Eval</span>. This comprehensive collection spans a wide variety of tasks and modalities, ensuring a thorough and balanced evaluation across different domains.</p>
</div>
