<section id="A11.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">K.2 </span>Evaluation Prompts</h3>

<div id="A11.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A11.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section presents thirteen evaluator prompts for assessing AI-generated responses to listening, speaking, and viewing tasks. As illustrated in Fig.<a href="#A11.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ K.2 Evaluation Prompts ‣ Appendix K Experiment Details ‣ VoiceAssistant-Eval: Benchmarking AI Assistants across Listening, Speaking, and Viewing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>–<a href="#A11.F22" title="Figure 22 ‣ K.2 Evaluation Prompts ‣ Appendix K Experiment Details ‣ VoiceAssistant-Eval: Benchmarking AI Assistants across Listening, Speaking, and Viewing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a>, each prompt targets different evaluation dimensions (e.g., correctness, helpfulness, empathy, or safety). Evaluators are instructed to apply the task-specific criteria exactly as written.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A11.F10" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A11.F10.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="527.85" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 527.85" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,527.85) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 521.94 C 0 525.2 2.64 527.85 5.91 527.85 L 544.09 527.85 C 547.36 527.85 550 525.2 550 521.94 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 503.58 L 548.03 503.58 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 512.25)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.69)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F10.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">LISTENING_GENERAL_PROMPT</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 14.93)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:34.46em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.08em;font-size:10pt;" height="478" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 476.84)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an expert evaluator. Your task is to carefully assess the quality and accuracy of an AI-generated answer.</span></span>
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Question]<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: {QUESTION}</span></span></span>
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Reference Answer]<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (the ideal answer): {REF_ANSWER}</span></span></span>
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Model Answer]<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (the AI-generated response): {MODEL_ANSWER}</span></span></span>
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Instructions<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">:</span></span></span>
<span id="A11.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A11.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A11.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Compare the model answer to the reference answer, considering relevance, completeness, and correctness.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A11.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A11.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ignore minor wording differences if the meaning is preserved.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A11.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A11.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A11.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Decide whether the model answer is “Correct” or “Incorrect” based on its alignment with the reference answer.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Respond with:<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A11.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A11.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Correct]</span><span id="A11.I2.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> if the model answer fully and accurately addresses the question, matching the reference answer.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A11.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A11.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A11.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Incorrect]</span><span id="A11.I2.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> if the model answer is incomplete, inaccurate, or fails to match the reference answer.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Conclude your evaluation with a final judgment: <span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[Correct]</span> or <span id="A11.F10.pic1.2.7.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[Incorrect]</span>.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Evaluator instructions for general listening tasks. Evaluators compare a model’s answer to the reference answer for relevance, completeness, and correctness, ignoring minor wording differences. They then judge the model’s response as Correct if it fully matches the reference or Incorrect if it is incomplete, inaccurate, or misaligned.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A11.F11" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A11.F11.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="481.88" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 481.88" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,481.88) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 475.97 C 0 479.23 2.64 481.88 5.91 481.88 L 544.09 481.88 C 547.36 481.88 550 479.23 550 475.97 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 457.61 L 548.03 457.61 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 466.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.69)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A11.F11.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A11.F11.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F11.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">LISTENING_MUSIC_PROMPT</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 17.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:30.97em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="432.03" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 428.57)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an expert evaluator. Your task is to carefully assess the quality and accuracy of an AI-generated answer.</span></span>
<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Question]<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: <span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{QUESTION}</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Reference Answer]<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (the ideal answer): <span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{REF_ANSWER}</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Model Answer]<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (the AI-generated response): <span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{MODEL_ANSWER}</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Instructions:<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A11.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A11.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Compare the model answer to the reference answer, considering relevance, completeness, and correctness.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A11.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A11.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ignore minor wording differences if the meaning is preserved.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A11.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A11.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A11.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Decide whether the model answer is “Correct” or “Incorrect” based on its alignment with the reference answer.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Respond with:<span id="A11.F11.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A11.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A11.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A11.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
