<span id="A11.I9.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A11.I9.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A11.I9.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Good]</span><span id="A11.I9.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> if the response is helpful and provides relevant, accurate, and useful advice that addresses the user’s question or need. It is clear, logical, and appropriate for the situation.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A11.I9.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
