<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Listening/General/670</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 454.56)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:56.56em;--ltx-fo-height:32.36em;--ltx-fo-depth:31.86em;font-size:10pt;" class="ltx_minipage" height="888.48" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 447.7)" width="36.62em"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<table id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:347.9pt;"><img src="2509.22651v1/appendix/error_examples/Listening_General_670/sound_audio_waveform.png" id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:505/139;" width="505" height="139" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:347.9pt;"><img src="2509.22651v1/appendix/error_examples/Listening_General_670/user_audio_0_waveform.png" id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:505/139;" width="505" height="139" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2EB;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Transcript: </span><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2EB;">Without mentioning any specific sounds from the audio, explain how the overall sound could symbolize the progress of technology throughout history and how it might encourage future innovations. Please keep your explanation within 150 words.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DCF4E5;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ref Answer:</span><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#DCF4E5;">The sound in the audio conjures images of the evolving prowess of human ingenuity. From the steam engine’s revolutionizing power to the breathtaking force of a spacecraft preparing for liftoff, each echo in the audio chronicles our ceaseless quest to push boundaries. … It’s a reminder that what once seemed impossible is merely a challenge awaiting our tenacity and innovation.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;height:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Qwen Answer:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:347.9pt;"><img src="2509.22651v1/appendix/error_examples/Listening_General_670/assistant_audio_0_waveform.png" id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:505/139;" width="505" height="139" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;">Well, you know, the overall sound could symbolize the progress of technology in a few ways. It might start with simple, basic sounds like the hum of an old radio, representing the early days of communication technology. Then, as time goes on, it could be the sound of a car engine revving, showing the development of transportation. And now, with the sound of a jet engine, it shows how far we’ve come in aviation. This progression can encourage future innovations because it shows that we can keep getting better. It gives us the confidence to keep pushing the boundaries and trying new things. So, what do you think about this? Do you have any other ideas?</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;height:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Model Judegement:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">&lt;analysis&gt; …
The model answer: They use "hum of an old radio", "car engine revving", "jet engine". These are specific sounds, but instructions said "Without mentioning any specific sounds from the audio". … The model answer is less impressive, more generic. … So it violates that constraint. …</span></span>
<span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">&lt;assistantfinal&gt; [Incorrect]</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</table></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
        
<figure id="A12.F24" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 24: </span>Requirement deviation example. The model’s answer references concrete sounds despite the instruction to avoid specific audio details, leading to an incorrect judgment.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
