<td id="A12.SS1.p3.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS1.p3.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS1.p3.pic1.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p3.pic1.2.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;">He talked about an isometric crystal. Graphite is an example of an isometric crystal. So, that’s the type of crystal he mentioned. If you want to know more about isometric crystals or graphite, feel free to ask.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS1.p3.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS1.p3.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;height:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
