<span id="A12.SS1.p3.pic1.2.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS1.p3.pic1.2.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Model Judegement:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
