<figure id="A12.F25" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 25: </span>Example of a speech perception error. The model answers “isometric crystal” with a graphite example, but the reference label is “isodesmic crystal,” so the response is judged incorrect.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
