We must evaluate the model answer relative to reference. Question: "What is the main genre of this musical piece? Please choose one of the following options: A. Experimental, B. Rock, C. Country, or D. Hip-Hop." The reference answer: "Rock". The model answer does not answer; it says not sure, asks for more details. It is incorrect.</span></span>
