<figure id="A12.F26" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 26: </span>Context-loss error in the Listening Music task. The prompt asks for the track’s main genre (A: Experimental, B: Rock, C: Country, D: Hip-Hop), with the reference answer “Rock.” Instead of selecting an option, the model requests more details, failing to use the provided audio context and yielding an incorrect response.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
