<span id="A12.SS2.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS2.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS2.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;">Well, it’s a bit hard to say just from this short description. But if we consider the lyrics and the mention of a Baltimore raven, it could be a bit of a stretch to fit it into a traditional genre like blues or rock. It might be more experimental or instrumental. So, I’d go with D for experimental. But, you know, it really depends on the full context of the track. What do you think?</span></span>
