<span id="A12.SS2.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS2.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS2.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">&lt;analysis&gt;
We need to check if the model answer matches the reference answer. The question: Which genre best describes this track? Say A for Blues, B for Rock, C for Instrumental, or D for Experimental.
Reference answer: Blues. Model answer says: "I’d go with D for experimental." That doesn’t match Blues. So the answer is Incorrect.</span></span>
<span id="A12.SS2.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS2.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">&lt;assistantfinal&gt; [Incorrect]</span></span>
