<figure id="A12.F27" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 27: </span>Sound-perception error in the Listening Music task. The model is asked to choose a genre (A: Blues, B: Rock, C: Instrumental, D: Experimental). The reference is “Blues,” but the model infers “Experimental (D)” from tenuous cues in the dialogue, misclassifying the track.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
