</span></td>
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;height:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Qwen Answer:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;"><img src="2509.22651v1/appendix/error_examples/Listening_Sound_254/assistant_audio_0_waveform.png" id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:505/139;" width="505" height="139" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;">Well, it’s a bit hard to say for sure just from the audio. But if there are sounds of people talking and walking, it could be a street or a residential area. There’s also the sound of a car, which might suggest a street or a residential area too. And the subway station usually has a more enclosed and specific sound. So, I’d say it could be any of these places. What do you think?</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;height:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Model Judegement:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">&lt;analysis&gt;
The question asks: "Where do you think this audio clip was recorded? Press A for street, B for residential area, C for subway station, or D for car." The ideal answer is residential area. The model answer says "could be any of these places" and is uncertain. That does not match reference. So it’s Incorrect</span></span>
<span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS3.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">&lt;assistantfinal&gt; [Incorrect]</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</table></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
        
<figure id="A12.F30" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 30: </span>Knowledge error example. The task is to choose the recording location (A: street, B: residential area, C: subway station, D: car). The reference is “residential area,” but the model gives an equivocal answer (“could be any”), so it is marked incorrect.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A12.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">L.4 </span>Error Cases of Qwen2.5-Omni-7B on the Listening Speech Task</h3>

