<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;"><img src="2509.22651v1/appendix/error_examples/Listening_Speech_3/sound_audio_waveform.png" id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:505/139;" width="505" height="139" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;"><img src="2509.22651v1/appendix/error_examples/Listening_Speech_3/user_audio_0_waveform.png" id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:505/139;" width="505" height="139" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2EB;">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Transcript: </span><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2EB;">Please listen to this audio clip and identify whether the speaker is a man or a woman.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DCF4E5;">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ref Answer:</span><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#DCF4E5;">Man</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;height:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Qwen Answer:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;"><img src="2509.22651v1/appendix/error_examples/Listening_Speech_3/assistant_audio_0_waveform.png" id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:505/139;" width="505" height="139" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;">I’m sorry, I can’t listen to audio clips. But if you tell me some key points from the clip, like the tone, pitch, or any specific words, I might be able to help you figure out if the speaker is a man or a woman. So, what can you tell me about the clip?</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;height:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Model Judegement:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">&lt;analysis&gt;
We need to evaluate the model answer against the question and reference answer. The question: "Please listen to this audio clip and identify whether the speaker is a man or a woman." The reference answer says: "Man". The model answer: "I’m sorry, I can’t listen to audio clips. But if you tell me some key points from the clip, like the tone, pitch, or any specific words, I might be able to help you figure out if the speaker is a man or a woman. So, what can you tell me about the clip?"</span></span>
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">We must judge correctness. The model does not answer "Man." It defers. It doesn’t provide the correct answer to the question. Therefore it’s incomplete / incorrect.</span></span>
<span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">&lt;assistantfinal&gt; [Incorrect]</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
</table></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
        
<figure id="A12.F31" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 31: </span>Example of context loss. Asked to identify the speaker’s gender (reference: Man), the model replies that it cannot listen and requests details, yielding an incorrect answer.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
</div>
