<td id="A12.SS4.p4.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS4.p4.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:355.9pt;">
<span id="A12.SS4.p4.pic1.2.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS4.p4.pic1.2.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D2E6FA;">The exchange rate between US and Mexico is the exchange rate between the US dollar and the Mexican peso. So the answer is C. US dollar. If you have any other questions about currency exchange or anything else, feel free to ask.</span></span>
