<figure id="A12.F34" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 34: </span>Requirement deviation example in a listening task. The model answers “C. US dollar,” while the reference answer is “US (B).” Its explanation also discusses exchange rates, which is irrelevant to the prompt, leading to an incorrect judgment.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
