</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2EB;">
<span id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Transcript: </span><span id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2EB;">Can you provide a list of health food brands owned by Hispanic founders?</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;height:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
<td id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" colspan="2">
<span id="A12.SS5.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
