<figure id="A12.F38" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 38: </span>Requirement deviation example. The user asks the assistant to complete a company description about “Hippoplaisir,” a Belgian psychology and counseling provider specializing in horse<span id="A12.F38.3" class="ltx_text">-</span>riding lessons. The assistant misinterprets the task, treats the name as a medical term, and asks for clarification instead of completing the sentence. The model judgment labels the response as Bad.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
</div>
</section>
