</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A12.SS6.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A12.SS6.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2EB;">
<span id="A12.SS6.p1.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:366.2pt;">
<span id="A12.SS6.p1.pic1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A12.SS6.p1.pic1.2.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Transcript: </span><span id="A12.SS6.p1.pic1.2.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2EB;">I’ve been waiting for this opportunity for so long, and now that it’s finally here, why do they expect me to just sit back and let someone else take what should be mine? Don’t they realize how hard I’ve worked for this?</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A12.SS6.p1.pic1.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
