<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 44: </span>Example of a speech perception error in the Speaking Multi Round task, where the model misunderstands monetary units and numerical values, leading to incorrect ordering.</figcaption>
</figure>
      
